  "answer_text": "The `bpf_ktime_get_coarse_ns` helper is not allowed for `kprobe` program types. Use `bpf_ktime_get_ns` instead, which is permitted for kprobe programs.\n\n```c\n#include <linux/bpf.h>\n#include <bpf/bpf_helpers.h>\n\nchar _license[] SEC(\"license\") = \"GPL\";\n\nSEC(\"kprobe\")\n__naked void entry(void)\n{\n\tasm volatile (\"\t\t\t\t\t\\\n\tcall %[bpf_ktime_get_ns];\t\t\t\\\n\tr0 = 0;\t\t\t\t\t\t\\\n\texit;\t\t\t\t\t\t\\\n\"\t:\n\t: __imm(bpf_ktime_get_ns)\n\t: __clobber_all);\n}\n```",
